B.a9v=new A.cm("n01","A Tafel slope of 42 mV/dec | indicated a rate-determining | first electron transfer.")
B.a9s=new A.cm("n02","The (111) reflection at 2\u03b8 = 43.6\xb0 | broadened as | the crystallite size fell.")
B.a9o=new A.cm("n03","Scherrer analysis gave | a crystallite size of 8.4 \xb1 0.6 nm | for the calcined powder.")
