B.a9F=new A.cm("n07","Ostwald ripening coarsened the particles, | whereas encapsulation | suppressed coalescence.")
B.a9y=new A.cm("n08","The kinetics followed | a Mars\u2013van Krevelen mechanism | rather than Langmuir\u2013Hinshelwood.")
