B.a9H=new A.cm("n22","The double-layer capacitance was | 28 \u03bcF/cm\xb2 | in one molar potassium hydroxide.")
B.a9K=new A.cm("n23","Selectivity toward ethylene | exceeded 71%, | whereas methane stayed below 3%.")
